{"rank": 489, "root": "عمر", "form": 2, "lemma": "عَمَّرَ", "count": 5, "ayahCount": 4, "share": 0.03, "meaning": {"bs": "dati dug život; obnoviti, izgraditi", "en": "to grant a long life; to build up, to renovate", "tr": "uzun ömür vermek; imar etmek, onarmak", "fr": "accorder une longue vie ; rebâtir, rénover", "id": "memberi umur panjang; memakmurkan, merenovasi", "ur": "لمبی عمر دینا؛ تعمیر کرنا، مرمت کرنا", "bn": "দীর্ঘ জীবন দেওয়া; নির্মাণ করা, সংস্কার করা", "fa": "عمر دراز دادن؛ آباد کردن، بازسازی کردن"}, "lemmaSpoken": "audio/aa219e0f4c17ab79e88a.m4a", "animation": "<svg class=\"va va-vemr_2\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 72\"><style> @keyframes vemr_2-0{from{transform:translateY(-30px)}}.va-vemr_2 .b0{opacity:1;animation:vemr_2-0 0.5s ease-in 0.3s both}.va-vemr_2 .b1{opacity:1;animation:vemr_2-0 0.5s ease-in 0.8s both}.va-vemr_2 .b2{opacity:1;animation:vemr_2-0 0.5s ease-in 1.3s both}.f,.p{fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.f{stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:4.5}.t{stroke-width:8}.h{fill:var(--accent)}.p{stroke:var(--gold);stroke-width:3}.q{fill:var(--gold)}.va-vemr_2.off,.va-vemr_2.off *{animation:none!important}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.va-vemr_2,.va-vemr_2 *{animation:none!important}}</style><path class=\"p\" d=\"M6 61H114\"/><path class=\"q\" d=\"M20 51h80v10H20zM20 39h28v10H20zM74 39h26v10H74zM20 27h18v10H20zM84 27h16v10H84z\"/><rect class=\"q b0\" x=\"50\" y=\"39\" width=\"22\" height=\"10\"/><rect class=\"q b1\" x=\"40\" y=\"27\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\"/><rect class=\"q b2\" x=\"62\" y=\"27\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\"/></svg> ", "principal": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "arabic": "عَمَّرَ", "plain": "عَمَّرَ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/aa219e0f4c17ab79e88a.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "arabic": "يُعَمِّرُ", "plain": "يُعَمِّرُ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/855dece05217a8d3f408.